PLACEHOLDER — replace this file with the actual urban_growth_cleaned.csv
========================================================================

This repository was set up before the dataset file was placed here.

Before running the analyses:

1. Export the final analytical dataset from the project spreadsheet
   (one row per included study, 183 rows total).
2. Save it as `data/urban_growth_cleaned.csv` using UTF-8 encoding.
3. Delete this placeholder file.

The column schema expected by the analysis scripts is documented in
`data/README.md`. The scripts use `read_csv()` from `readr`, so standard
RFC 4180 CSV with a header row is correct.

If you prefer to work from the project spreadsheet directly, the
`00_main_analysis.Rmd` chunk `load-data` is the only place that reads the
CSV — point it at your preferred source there.
